{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_x_021jun_2_1_2_021_12",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:404ea7540cc090b754b1b1888cfe0bdf9979617aaf018b1a472176465d294801",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_x_021jun_2_1_2_021_12:1_2_021_12_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:25d49a1c0879ef06730d4ed64936b27d3ca57d736168c861067996549b2b27d9",
      "text": "派对的主角是",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_021jun_2_1_2_021_12:1_2_021_12_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a72cba355e2017372aca00c6c49ba55cbb8c54e4f87bb34c592a0a924e295589",
      "text": "某天放学后，High×Joker的成员们商量起\n旬的生日事宜。\n考虑到即使搞惊喜也会被旬看穿，\n大家决定提前告诉旬。\n看着大家兴高采烈筹备的样子，旬……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_021jun_2_1_2_021_12:1_2_021_12_a:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a54fd8ced9ce84f8899188bb017883a203f409bae897cb393190cf281ad339f8",
      "text": "虽说又要工作又要上学\n挺辛苦的，但准备得非常完美呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_021jun_2_1_2_021_12:1_2_021_12_a:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fe8a1dc4b5bd0c6e6b84f5fd1dfee307af6ad260fab669f38190314e5b84daa9",
      "text": "旬会高兴吗。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_021jun_2_1_2_021_12:1_2_021_12_a:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:817565a234eeef8b15b2be086c183ed4a7e0005b77da91a7b1d013c710161a77",
      "text": "我特意为了旬亲\n买了“今日主角”绶带哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_021jun_2_1_2_021_12:1_2_021_12_a:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6d916e4c3059998c97b75ed82388bdf971f0a076109f70bc04b6e298162d3149",
      "text": "他会……戴上吗……？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_021jun_2_1_2_021_12:1_2_021_12_a:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7a7f34303fa9b2d1784e4e827d12cddefe19988d562b49341d2aa1de8f32deee",
      "text": "哎呀，谁知道呢？\n不过要是能戴上就好了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_021jun_2_1_2_021_12:1_2_021_12_b:cmd-000018:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:16e79ef81bb363513ea2ae498ef57acec06879c79e6396c5f9d64189bd7e6223",
      "text": "我有个请求想拜托旬，\n可以吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_021jun_2_1_2_021_12:1_2_021_12_b:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7b34fca5fbab4a7ed17ab8c7b012b318b0946c7f97ce3cd6d7baaa3b2429a5d3",
      "text": "看具体是什么事吧，\n请问怎么了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_021jun_2_1_2_021_12:1_2_021_12_b:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:72f635530b31fb03bec5a420c63634ea6489ad74da8d5c74a9b4849778f40e06",
      "text": "四季买回来的绶带，\n你要不要戴一下试试？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_021jun_2_1_2_021_12:1_2_021_12_b:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b2c046f3f6acd6f64a7516d82973f0d3ddb7857d9f284cff0911fa32825faa87",
      "text": "我拒绝。\n心意我就领了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_021jun_2_1_2_021_12:1_2_021_12_b:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:43f0bf3daa7364444d79361abbb8ab97416e8837ce4b62b8f083b428f445a048",
      "text": "哈哈，我就知道会这样。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_021jun_2_1_2_021_12:1_2_021_12_c:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:22c0df30594382144f91829499d2cccc190202e7e490823d0dd33ee107ff3e37",
      "text": "旬的生日……今年也，\n能庆祝真开心……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_021jun_2_1_2_021_12:1_2_021_12_c:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1517ae7be2391160359d1c9a2c2a78f7ecb0a8b455aaa28456ee1a9686ef8aac",
      "text": "每年都谢谢你了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_021jun_2_1_2_021_12:1_2_021_12_c:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:46b087ffdc31f4b5f9029e89dde23b00a596a2edf92e5ce47d66f042778a7a03",
      "text": "明年，后年也，\n想帮你……庆祝……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_021jun_2_1_2_021_12:1_2_021_12_c:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5833fc056723e155023bad3ec2861fb017914b33b3db6f8567c55fd248aa62b2",
      "text": "明年和后年也……吗。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_021jun_2_1_2_021_12:1_2_021_12_c:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b4cc3e2f81fb26d6fbc2ec22590bf2e22c1a72ca5721e454717b7fbdbdf613c8",
      "text": "这样啊。\n我等着你哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_021jun_2_1_2_021_12:1_2_021_12_d:cmd-000017:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9e7e3fedd410e6cd6fee74856d69a031500827483b3121d3ad3592dbba62a53e",
      "text": "旬，今天感觉怎么样？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_021jun_2_1_2_021_12:1_2_021_12_d:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d16031ad0041586c61f613648298325a2db146421c5db20f6ad1bbd06d8c567e",
      "text": "大家都很努力地准备了哦。\n四季和隼人他们还商量到了很晚呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_021jun_2_1_2_021_12:1_2_021_12_d:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:39ef811c0c901eeda93cdba5e66b2b2a815feb467a8c67d463f09ad2d069c079",
      "text": "还准备了旬喜欢的食物之类的呢。\n当然，我也准备了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_021jun_2_1_2_021_12:1_2_021_12_d:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:11b0778dc1c775072c8a10fbb3b6926a4531570072f479c3cfbc4c3869460552",
      "text": "……我知道。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_021jun_2_1_2_021_12:1_2_021_12_d:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e9532619663b59c2aa7f7f8e24779d4730cd11bdf0e323fca00a009526de4b56",
      "text": "春名先生也是，各种方面\n都非常感谢您。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_021jun_2_1_2_021_12:1_2_021_12_e:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:37e749bf2050187dcc0ef0003caa500140b463e4cb1eb262703a744ba1abeeb4",
      "text": "这是我下大本钱送的礼物！\n当当——！猫猫吉祥物玩偶！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_021jun_2_1_2_021_12:1_2_021_12_e:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cd44c4ec063f168a32e8eb5f50716d05cf62a3102d68c3f76ecb3e94ec0ec41e",
      "text": "材质超讲究的超稀有款哦！\n来，给你！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_021jun_2_1_2_021_12:1_2_021_12_e:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:790949f15ccb9358975eb17a99bc47a98e997389c5d9dcdc0566479f459ba8d7",
      "text": "Mega可爱，我超推荐的！\n摸起来手感也绝赞☆",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_021jun_2_1_2_021_12:1_2_021_12_e:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:336a16e064dce13938be339635dd5193e800c6b6e56343ac5072ce7e38c8387c",
      "text": "……毛茸茸的呢。简直像真的猫一样……\n……啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_021jun_2_1_2_021_12:1_2_021_12_e:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:27e5bcaf1e11cf92bc820a49a097b4df87aae31db7b5bc8676d4e645241e68bf",
      "text": "那我就心怀感激地收下了。\n非常感谢。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
